ftClauricorn2.description:
{green|Leprechaun}



{gold|Special Ability : Spellcaster (Fortune). Unbelievable Luck. }

Leprechaun can cast Fortune three times per battle at the advanced level. Spell lasts for 6 rounds. Every Luck increasing modificators (spells, artifacts etc.) have double effect at Leprechauns.

ftMoonDeer1.description:
{green|Moon Deer}



{gold|Special Ability : Immune to Slow spell}

Spell immunity is creature special ability which makes them unable to be target of the specific spell or a range of spells. The immunity also regards creature abilities which cause the same effect as the specific spell or spells (for example, Troglodytes are immune to the Blind spell as well as Unicorns' blinding special ability), even if technically this ability doesn't mean respective spell (for example, Gold and Black Dragons are immune to the Resurrection spell as well as Archangels' resurrecting special ability).

The Orb of Vulnerability can bypass some spell immunities.

ftMoonDeer2.description:
{green|Sun Deer}



{gold|Special Ability : Immune to Slow spell. Can cast Solar Power spell after attack.}

Sun Deers have 20% chance to cast Solar Power spell after they attack. 2-hexed Solar Power spell increases permanently Sun Deers attack and defense by 10%.

